# HitSave — socket compose paths (agents)

Global policy: **`agent-docker-socket-compose.mdc`** (user rules). **Orchestrators are not the failure mode; agent shell commands are.**

## Path contract

- **`ARCHIVER_HOST_PATH`**: host checkout used for **`--project-directory`** and bind mounts when compose runs **through a container’s Docker socket**
- Align **`windmill_ops/docker/.env`**, **`worker-paths.env`**, and actual bind mounts — one tree, not worktree vs e2e mix
- Recreate the socket client container after path env changes

## Wrappers (required)

- **`remote_intake_archiver_compose`** — **`scripts/remote-intake/common.sh`**
- **`archiver_compose`** — **`windmill_ops/lib/hitsave-env.sh`** when present

No **`cd /archiver && docker compose`** via **`docker exec`**. Operator **`cd hitsave-archiver && docker compose`** on the host stays the default for manual ops.

## Restarts

**`docker compose up -d --no-deps <service>`** — **`compose-targeted-restart.mdc`**.
